WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.200
Now that you have your hands in the perfect position

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:06.040
and your body is ready, let's talk about the actual push.

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:08.760
To properly pump the heart from the outside,

00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:12.880
you need to push down at least two inches for an adult.

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:15.600
A good rule of thumb is to aim for about one third

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:17.879
of the depth of the person's chest.

00:00:17.879 --> 00:00:20.860
Take a moment now to practice a few deep compressions

00:00:20.860 --> 00:00:22.200
on your mannequin.

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:25.940
Feel how much force it takes to reach that two inch mark.

00:00:25.940 --> 00:00:28.000
As you practice on your mannequins,

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:30.959
pay close attention to the feedback they give you.

00:00:30.959 --> 00:00:33.360
Many mannequins have lights that turn green

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:36.360
or make a clicking sound when you hit that target depth.

